title: Beauty Mayo Face Mask

! Beauty Mayo Face Mask

Massage a small amount of [[mayonnaise|Mayonnaise]] into your face. Rinse off with warm water.

You can also apply liberally and let it sit for 10-15 minutes before rinsing off.

